{"blocks":[{"type":"paragraph","text":"みなさまこんばんは！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"北野日奈子です(｡・・｡)♪"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"今日は一日オフだったので\n美容院に久しぶりに行ってきたよ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"写メはとってないんだけど\n少しだけ暗くしました！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"きっと、すぐ色抜けちゃうんだろうな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"後ろの髪は揃えてもらったけど\n短くはしてません！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"次行くときもきっと短くしないで\nその次かまたその次行くときくらいは\n髪の毛切っちゃおうかな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"でも、この間のSHOWroomで\nモイ少し長いのがみてみたい！っていう\n意見の方が多いことがわかったから\n伸ばしてみようかなっ！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"そーだ！そのとき一緒に集計した\n花奈さんのボブりんはどうなるんだろう！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"花奈さんを好きになった時期が\nボブりんの頃だから\n生でもみてみたいな～"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"二期生が加入した頃には\nすでにボブじゃなかったから\n生でみたことないの！"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/17/7478336/0000.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/hinako.kitano/img/files/46/_pre/blog/hinako.kitano/img/2016/11/17/7478336/0001.jpeg","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊織ちゃんおでかけいこー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"下町散歩しよー"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"伊